<p>I don't know how I feels about this one, mainly because this is a documented condition that affects real people. I'm thinking that the Foundation is doing a rather poor job of containment if they are allowing putting these people on TV. To me it feels like someone writing up obsessive-compulsive disorder and treating it like a memetic disease.</p>
<p>There's no twist, there's little to no interpretation, and for me it feels the same as someone writing up their favorite superhero/video game character into an SCP. Downvote.</p>
